WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
1. Choose flush fitting near the intended pose

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
2. Start on the moving side of the seam

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
3. Finish the neighbor side and check the preview

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
4. Include every seam that must remain aligned

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.042
Motion replay: balance height and tilt across both seams.

00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:17.042
5. Apply and inspect surface continuity
